Keep a shared best as 0.
Keep a shared maxzeros as 0.
Set maxzeros to 5.
Keep a shared maxones as 0.
Set maxones to 3.
Keep a shared usedzeros as 0.
Keep a shared usedones as 0.
To walk from spot (a whole number) with taken (a whole number).
If spot is more than last and taken is more than best, set best to taken.
If spot is more than last, return.
Walk from spot plus 1 with taken.
The zcost is item spot of zeros.
The ocost is item spot of ones.
If usedzeros plus zcost is at most maxzeros and usedones plus ocost is at most maxones.
Add zcost to usedzeros.
Add ocost to usedones.
Walk from spot plus 1 with taken plus 1.
